{color.GG}Avalib {color.N}lists available libraries grouped by their source directories, making it easier to discover and navigate framework and system libraries.

Usage: {color.GG}avalib {color.CC}[--allpath] [--only <path>]{color.N}

Example:
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avalib{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avalib {color.CC}--only lib/std/shell{color.N}
    {color.R}- {color.GG}avalib {color.CC}--allpath --only lib/std/go{color.N}